    },
    {
      "target_claim_id": "C2",
      "defect_type": "arithmetic",
      "evidence_ids": ["EP_0010_E01"],
      "explanation": "The claim states earnings from operations decreased by 51.26%, but the filing's results summary table (Item 7) shows a rounded (41)% change. Calculating from the cited fact values: (18,964 - 32,287) / 32,287 * 100 = -41.26...%, which rounds to -41.26% at two decimals. The claim's -51.26% is arithmetically incorrect; it appears to use the wrong denominator or a miscalculation. The correct calculated decline is approximately 41.26%.",
